    {
      "id": "111479998247290_1066747169448475",
      "message": "Looking for glowing, healthy skin? At Face by Sumona, we offer advanced HydraFacial treatments with our 7-in-1 combo machine. This modern technology deeply cleanses, hydrates, and rejuvenates your skin in one session.\n\n💆 What We Offer\n- Deep cleansing & exfoliation for clear pores\n\n- Hydration therapy to restore moisture\n\n- Oxygen infusion for a fresh glow\n\n- RF lifting & ultrasound to tighten and firm\n\n- LED light therapy for acne and anti-aging\n\n👩‍🎓 Why Choose Us\n- Certified beautician with professional training\n\n- Safe, hygienic salon environment\n\n- Conveniently located in Tongi, Bangladesh\n\n- Affordable packages for regular skincare",
      "created_time": "2026-09-22T20:20:36+0000",
      "updated_time": "2026-09-22T20:20:36+0000",
      "permalink_url": "https://www.facebook.com/1084692537653938/posts/1066747169448475"
    },
    {
